From ffce4c4f40eaa886dd1032c20abc3856ed2bf8bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:39:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: remove the unreachable second amulet tier from the home
 score

borg_power_home_aux1() takes points off the home score for keeping too
many items of one type.  For amulets it subtracts 1500 for each amulet
past the third, and then, in the else of that test, repeats the same
condition (num_neck > 3) for a gentler 700-point tier.  The else is
only reached when num_neck > 3 is false, so that tier could never run.

Remove it.  No behaviour change: the 1500-point penalty past three
amulets is unchanged.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#47.

(cherry picked from commit e9080f35f1d2e8c8166116d0025d2e61e499899e)
---
 src/borg/borg-home-power.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-home-power.c b/src/borg/borg-home-power.c
index 7b2421950..667134912 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-home-power.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-home-power.c
@@ -321,8 +321,6 @@ static int32_t borg_power_home_aux1(void)
         value -= (num_rings - 4) * 2000L;
     if (num_neck > 3)
         value -= (num_neck - 3) * 1500L;
-    else if (num_neck > 3)
-        value -= (num_neck - 3) * 700L;
     if (num_armor > 6)
         value -= (num_armor - 6) * 1000L;
     if (num_cloaks > 3)
-- 
